# Firebase client configuration.
#
# Per-project configuration supplied by the project owner, not source. It is
# ignored so that adding it locally to enable push cannot accidentally commit
# it, and so the repository never carries one project's Firebase identifiers.
# Service-account keys and Admin SDK credentials are server-side and must
# never be placed in this module at all.
google-services.json
app/google-services.json
